    "Looking at the Superstore Sales data set revealed important insights into how customers buy, sales trends by month, product categories, and how sensitive sales are to discounts.\n",
    "\n",
    "The Consumer customer segment accounts for the highest revenue contribution, with Technology being the leading product segment in sales and profit. Sales report for the period indicates that November, December and September are the demand high months, implying a seasonal demand towards the end of the year.\n",
    "\n",
    "The pricing analysis also indicates that higher discount percentages typically lead to lower profitability. Specific attention needs to be given to Furniture, as it contributes high turnover with a low profit margin.\n",
    "\n",
    "In general, the company would want to capitalize on its high quality and high-profit product categories. In summary, the business should aim at strengthening its profitable product areas, building customer relationships, planning for seasonal demand and devising a more useful discount strategy."
